{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","森罗万象"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","生命值较低时回到布阵处扎根。主动释放时击飞目标及其周围敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯生命值比例首次低于30%时回到己方后排的空布阵格扎根并恢复30% + 2% HP生命值。扎根状态下，奥曼斯无法移动并处于霸体状态，普通攻击变为远程并对主目标周围1格范围内的其他敌人造成50%的伤害。主动释放时，选择一名敌人，击飞目标及其周围1格范围内的敌人并造成200% + 20% ATK伤害，同时附带4% HP伤害。优先选择攻击范围内敌人最密集的区域释放。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":138,"end":144,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":43,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":63,"end":65,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"},{"start":134,"end":148,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":155,"end":160,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至230% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","主动释放时造成伤害提高至240% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":22,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":26,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","深林庇护"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","为自己添加护盾，护盾被击破时对周围敌人造成伤害。扎根后改为最靠前友军添加护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯为自己添加25% + 3% HP的护盾持续10秒，当护盾被击破或消失时，对周围1格范围内的其他敌军造成160% + 15% ATK伤害。扎根状态下，改为使最靠前的友军获得该护盾。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":16,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":58,"end":64,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"},{"start":54,"end":68,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":80,"end":83,"tooltip_key":"keyword:frontest"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至28% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至32% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","护盾量提升至35% + 3% HP。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":6,"end":17,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","生生不息"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","持续恢复生命值。扎根时改为恢复能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，奥曼斯每秒恢复3.5% + 0.5%的已损失生命值。扎根状态下改为每秒恢复30 + 4点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":22,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":43,"end":47,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至4% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至32 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":29,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至4.5% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至34 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":13,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":35,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","生命值恢复量提升至5% + 0.5%，能量恢复量提升至36 + 4点。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":29,"end":33,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身最大生命值。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升17%。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升23%。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身的最大生命值提升29%。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","根蔓御敌"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","敌方被击倒后延长其倒地时间，并对其造成伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","奥曼斯通过树根感知战场情况，当有敌人受到击飞、击倒或强制位移后，奥曼斯会用树根将目标捆倒在地，延长其2秒倒地时间，并造成80% ATK伤害，该效果对同一名敌人每10秒最多触发一次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":60,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至100%。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","该技能造成伤害时附带60点生命汲取效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至120%。"],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","技能“深林庇护”提供的护盾被击破时还会击退周围敌人。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","技能“深林庇护”提供的护盾被击破或消失时，还会击退周围敌军1格。"],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","古木新枝"]]}